OL,3,GNEWSAYoungster science outreach scheme
OL,4,Awins top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outreach programme encouraging
OL,7,Fyoungsters from all backgrounds across
OL,8,Fthe north-east of England to get
OL,9,Finvolved in science-related subjects
OL,10,Fhas won a prestigious award.
OL,12,FNorthumbria University's NUSTEM engages
OL,13,Fwith families, schools and businesses
OL,14,Fto promote a broader understanding of
OL,15,Fscience, technology, engineering and
OL,16,Fmaths (STEM).
