OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYoungster science outreach scheme
OL,4,Awins top award
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts work to inspire future generations
OL,7,Fand support efforts to diversify the
OL,8,Fsector has gained it the Royal Society
OL,9,FAthena Prize 2026, which will be
OL,10,Fawarded at a ceremony in London in
OL,11,FNovember.
OL,13,FSpeaking on behalf of the team,
OL,14,FProfessor Carol Davenport said it was
OL,15,Fdelighted and encouraged to receive
OL,16,Fsuch an endorsement of its work.
